+    <section class="philosophy-section" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="philosophy-title"><div class="wrap philosophy-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" lang="en">02 / OUR APPROACH</p><h2 id="philosophy-title">好豆子有自己的声音。<br>我们做的，是认真倾听。</h2><div class="roast-drawing" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 430 120"><path d="M10 96h405M35 108V18m0 65c58-63 78 26 128-9s83-20 118-42 73-21 114-24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="163" cy="74" r="4" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="281" cy="32" r="4" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M163 75v22m118-65v65" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="3 5" opacity=".4"/></svg><span lang="en">TIME, TEMPERATURE & A LITTLE PATIENCE.</span></div></div><div class="principles"><article><span class="principle-number">01</span><div><h3>风味，始于产地</h3><p class="measure-prose">我们关心一颗豆子从哪里来，也关心它如何被种植与处理。先理解产地，再决定如何烘焙。</p></div></article><article><span class="principle-number">02</span><div><h3>小批次，多一点耐心</h3><p class="measure-prose">每一锅都记录，每一次都杯测。用适合豆子的烘焙曲线，留下清晰的香气、甜感与层次。</p></div></article><article><span class="principle-number">03</span><div><h3>好喝，不必很复杂</h3><p class="measure-prose">咖啡可以是探索，也可以只是一个舒服的早晨。我们愿意和你聊风味，也乐意帮你找到简单的冲煮方式。</p></div></article></div></div></section>
